$string['sitesearchgovernance_desc'] = 'Which content areas the agent indexes for semantic site search. Every area is OFF by default — nothing is indexed until you enable it here. The estimate shows the expected index size (documents and chunks) with a traffic light BEFORE you enable an area; no embedding call is made for it. Access is always re-checked per search result, so a user only ever finds content they may already see. Disabling an area removes its indexed rows immediately.';
