$string['updatehint_body'] = '<p>This update introduces the Booking Wizard — an AI-assisted helper that works directly inside the booking activity. Tasks can be expressed in natural language instead of being carried out through nested forms: create and edit booking options, attach images, manage participants, and diagnose booking, access and notification issues.</p><p><strong>Free trial mode.</strong> The Booking Wizard can be enabled in just a few clicks — no setup, no payment details — so you can evaluate it without commitment.</p><p><strong>Data protection.</strong> The Booking Wizard is designed for GDPR compliance: personal data is anonymised before it is passed to the language model — it only ever leaves your system in pseudonymised form.</p><p><strong>Extensible.</strong> The feature set is not fixed. Developers can add their own skills, tailored to their platform, to adapt the Booking Wizard to institution-specific workflows.</p><p>After the update you will find the Booking Wizard inside the booking activity. Using Moodle permissions, it can also be shown role-specifically in the navigation bar on any page.</p>';
$string['updatehint_heading'] = 'New in Booking: the Booking Wizard';
